    "semantic_summary": "This component orchestrates the entire chat interaction lifecycle, acting as the primary high-level service layer. It manages session persistence by routing memory via ChatSessionRouter, resolves the necessary AI model and system prompt via BrainHub, and handles message formatting using ChatMessageFormatter. It supports both synchronous and streaming LLM responses via ChatResponseHandler, ensuring proper history saving after every turn."
